#21102
The Grove of Screaming Fruit~
   Heavy fruit hangs from these trees, swollen and red, each one the size of
a head. When the wind moves them, they scream. The ground is covered in
burst fruit and the seeds inside them, which are teeth, and which have begun
to put down roots.
