#21103
The Glade of the Hanged Knight~
   A knight in silver armour hangs from a great tree by vines grown through
his arms and legs, his armour pierced by branches. He has hung here for
years, and he is not dead; the tree feeds on him and keeps him alive. His
eyes open, and he begs you to kill him. The tree does not want you to.
~
