#21107
The Glade of Mourning~
   A glade of white trees, their bark smooth and pale as bone. Women in
white walk among them, wringing their hands, their faces hidden by their
hair. They are weeping for everyone the forest has taken, and their weeping
is a sound that stops hearts.
