#21110
The Heart Grove~
   The trees part around a vast clearing. In its centre stands the Weeping
Mother, a tree larger than a castle, its bark a mass of faces, its branches
hung with sleeping people wrapped in bark like cocoons. This was the first
grove the Nu'Groth reached, long ago, and every tree in the forest grew from
her seed.
~
