#21111
The Edge of the Forest~
   The trees end abruptly at the foot of a black cliff that rises into the
clouds. Built into the cliff, and out of it, is a fortress of black stone so
vast that its walls are lost in the mist above. War-horns sound from its
towers. This is the Nu'Groth's outer fortress, and its gate is open.
~
